{"3691410": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Dead Pulse", "steam_appid": 3691410, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world has fallen. The infected never stop. You build. You trap. You fight.<br>Each night they return, faster, stronger, and deadlier. Place traps, unlock new weapons, and hold your ground as long as you can. Every run pushes you to adapt, reload, and survive just a little longer. <strong>Dead Pulse</strong> is an action roguelike shooter where every choice matters, every mistake hurts, and every second counts. Can you outlast the apocalypse?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build, Trap &amp; Survive</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Construct and fortify your base with deadly traps to fend off waves of relentless undead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ever-Changing Onslaught</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face increasingly terrifying zombie hordes with each new wave of attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691410/extras/3eb8e62a9ddab0460bb56e6a93ffdc44.poster.avif?t=1771430354\" width=800 height=436 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691410/extras/3eb8e62a9ddab0460bb56e6a93ffdc44.webm?t=1771430354\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691410/extras/3eb8e62a9ddab0460bb56e6a93ffdc44.mp4?t=1771430354\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Enemy Types</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hone your tactics against fast runners, armored tanks, and nightmare creatures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlock Powerful Weapons</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new 